2026-07-27T12:13:08.2343732Z i /tmp/RtmpYHsI6m/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2344206Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2344740Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2345209Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2345990Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2347337Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:13:08.2348714Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
